// Title: Suspicious Usage Of Active Directory Diagnostic Tool (ntdsutil.exe)
// ID: a58353df-af43-4753-bad0-cd83ef35eef5
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-14
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.003
// Description: Detects execution of ntdsutil.exe to perform different actions such as restoring snapshots...etc.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "snapshot") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "mount "))) OR ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "ac") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " i") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " ntds")))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\ntdsutil.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "ntdsutil.exe"))))
